{
  "SM_003040_0080_NAR": "If he did not return to Inferno soon,\r\nCheshire would surely die.\r\nThe thought that he was chasing\r\nthe whims of a love-struck child\r\nsent his blood boiling with rage.",
  "SM_003035_0020_CER": "“You know,\r\nyou still haven't told me your name.”",
  "SM_003020_0030_NAR": "Cheshire only shook his head,\r\nlest his voice betray the fact\r\nthat he was shaken.",
  "CE_003040_0010_CER": "I have to help him!",
  "SM_003020_0080_CER": "“If I'm going to be an Umbra Witch,\r\nI can't be afraid of an \r\novergrown lizard like that. \r\nWe'll get him next time, Cheshire!”",
  "SM_003035_0010_CER": "“R-really? Thanks...”",
  "SM_003020_0000_NAR": "With its armour in tatters\r\nthe dragon turned tail and fled.",
  "SM_003080_0040_FAS": "“You're not hurt, are you?”",
  "SM_003010_0040_NAR": "For once, Cheshire had \r\nno mocking retort.",
  "SM_003035_0080_LUC": "“But as a witch, \r\nI believe you have the power\r\nto break that curse.”",
  "SM_003080_0200_FAS": "“I may be able to take you \r\nto somewhere you've been before.”",
  "CE_003050_0000_CER": "Eat up now...\r\nUntil that big belly of yours bursts!",
  "LV_003010_0000_CER": "Hey, this looks familiar.",
  "SM_003050_0140_MOR": "“Remember this if you hope to \r\ntake on any more monsters\r\nin that forest and live to tell the tale.”",
  "LV_003910_0040_CER": "I...I want to be stronger!",
  "BK_3000_0030_CER": "“You don't scare me...\r\nNot any more!”",
  "SM_003030_0010_NAR": "Cheshire turned away.\r\nHe seemed almost as down as\r\nafter their last encounter with the monster.",
  "SM_003035_0120_LUC": "“Yes...even after countless moons my mother\r\nstill waits for me outside the forest.”",
  "BK_3030_0070_CER": "\r\n“Cheshire!”",
  "LV_003920_0000_CER": "I...no...I can't...",
  "SM_003050_0130_MOR": "“Skill at controlling a demon\r\ndetermines one's worth as a witch.”\r\n",
  "LV_003035_0010_NAR": "Cheshire growled for Cereza to go.",
  "SM_003035_0150_LUC": "“We can leave this forest together.\r\nI will help you save your mother,\r\nand we can all live as \r\nfamilies once again!”",
  "LV_003020_0000_CER": "Are these...claw marks?",
  "BK_3030_0080_NAR": "It was only a matter of time before\r\nCheshire was overwhelmed.\r\nIs this how our tale ends...?",
  "LV_003035_0020_NAR": "But Cereza could not muster the strength to say anything back.",
  "SM_003030_0050_NAR": "Cereza's celebration had been ruined\r\nbefore it could even begin.",
  "SM_003050_0090_MOR": "“Listen Cereza, I have begun my\r\npreparations to get you out of that forest.”",
  "LV_003905_0010_NAR": "The monster's body was hard as steel.\r\nCheshire let out a frustrated growl.",
  "LV_003040_0000_NAR": "Cereza could just make out the Water Shrine \r\nin the distance. Before it stood a strange \r\ncontraption built from thick metal pipes.",
  "SM_003080_0070_CER": "“You know, don't you?”",
  "CE_003805_0000_CER": "That...that might work!",
  "BK_3020_0090_NAR": "Giving in to her fear,\r\nCereza scooped up Cheshire, and ran.",
  "LV_003025_0000_NAR": "An ancient tree, long felled,\r\nbared its fangs at Cereza.",
  "SM_003035_0060_CER": "“Lukaon, who are you?\r\nWhy are you doing \r\nso much to help me?”",
  "SM_003020_0070_NAR": "A part of him realised that if it\r\nwere not for Cereza's actions,\r\nhe would currently be dragon food.\r\n\r\nBut he just could not accept \r\nthat he had been saved by someone\r\nhe considered so far beneath him.",
  "SM_003080_0030_FAS": "“And you've destroyed \r\nanother Elemental Core, \r\nbut you don't seem happy?”",
  "LV_003050_0020_NAR": "But she knew it was too late to turn back.",
  "LV_003045_0030_CER": "I...I...",
  "LV_003915_0000_NAR": "Cereza held back her tears,\r\npushing herself forward with all her might.",
  "LV_003050_0010_NAR": "As the words came out, Cereza was gripped by fear.",
  "SM_003010_0000_NAR": "They had escaped with their lives,\r\nbut Cheshire was furious at \r\nCereza for her cowardly retreat.",
  "SM_003040_0070_CER": "“I-I know what it sounds like,\r\nbut it's all coming true!\r\nThe Elemental Cores were just as\r\nLukaon said, right?\r\nThese are more than mere dreams!”",
  "SM_003080_0190_FAS": "“I know the secret \r\npathways of this forest.”",
  "SM_003080_0000_FAS": "“Well, who do we have here.\r\nFrankly, I'm surprised \r\nyou've made it this far.”",
  "CE_003020_0000_CER": "Ah-!",
  "SM_003080_0140_FAS": "“No one who has entered that \r\nfortress has ever made it out.\r\nStill sure you want to go?”",
  "SM_003020_0100_NAR": "The prideful demon turned away,\r\nand pretended not to hear her.\r\n",
  "LV_003060_0000_CER": "I have to help Cheshire!",
  "SM_003035_0110_CER": "“You are also trying to find\r\nyour mother, aren't you?”",
  "SM_003020_0090_NAR": "As she said these words\r\nCheshire noticed something \r\nin Cereza not present in the timid\r\ngirl he had met earlier.",
  "PH_3020_0000_CER": "There's got to be something\r\nI can do to save him!",
  "SM_003080_0170_FAS": "“But with your teamwork, \r\nmaybe you don't have \r\nmuch to worry about?”",
  "LV_003075_0020_NAR": "What were these cages for...? Cereza started to wonder, then decided it'd be best not to know.",
  "SM_003020_0020_CER": "“Cheshire, are you okay? \r\nAny serious injuries?”",
  "SM_003040_0100_CER": "“Lukaon could teach you a thing \r\nor two about how to talk to a lady...”",
  "SM_003040_0010_NAR": "Cheshire noticed\r\nCereza's flushed cheeks\r\nand stared at her inquisitively.",
  "BK_3000_0020_NAR": "The time had come to settle the\r\nscore once and for all.",
  "SM_003050_0120_CER": "“Y-yes ma'am!”",
  "LV_003005_0000_CER": "What is this...?\r\n",
  "LV_003010_0010_NAR": "They had been here before.\r\nTheir trek around the forest had \r\nbrought them back to their starting point.",
  "SM_003080_0100_CER": "“Come on, don't hold out on us!”",
  "SM_003080_0090_CER": "“You sound like my teacher!”",
  "SM_003035_0180_LUC": "“I feel the same way.\r\nI have never met another who\r\nunderstood my pain...shared my dream...”",
  "BK_3030_0050_NAR": "Cheshire continued his fierce \r\nassault, but with each exchange \r\nhe was gradually losing ground.",
  "BK_8110_0030_CER": "“Yeah, this won't get you home either,\r\nbut I'm sure it will help us get closer!”\r\n",
  "SM_003050_0070_NAR": "Words of praise from Morgana\r\nwere as rare as igloos in Inferno.\r\nIt took all of Cereza's willpower\r\nnot to jump for joy.",
  "SM_003050_0000_MOR": "“Cereza, thank Sheba you're safe.”",
  "LV_003905_0000_CER": "Ugh...no good.\r\nHe's too strong!",
  "LV_003910_0050_CES": "What can you possibly do?\r\nEveryone knows you're a failure.",
  "BK_3030_0130_CER": "“I am going to be a witch.\r\nI need to be strong!”",
  "BK_3030_0020_NAR": "Half by instinct, Cereza found\r\nher way to a hiding spot.\r\nWithout a moment of hesitation,\r\nCheshire threw himself at the enemy.",
  "SM_003035_0050_LUC": "“Cereza...what a lovely name...”",
  "BK_3030_0100_CER": "“I still...can't save anyone...”",
  "BK_3030_0010_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Go hide somewhere![FONT:N ]\r\nyelled Cheshire, preparing for battle.",
  "BK_3030_0090_CER": "“I-I can't...”",
  "SM_003050_0040_NAR": "Unable to contain her childish glee,\r\nCereza explained how they had\r\ntaken down the Jabberwock.",
  "BK_8110_0000_CER": "“Another element!”",
  "SM_003020_0050_CER": "“I wonder if that faerie will be back.\r\nBut now we know it's not \r\ncompletely invincible!”",
  "CE_003010_0000_CER": "Cheshire! \r\nLet's use your stone elemental power!",
  "SM_003040_0060_NAR": "Cheshire was speechless.\r\nEntering the forest based on a\r\nhalf-remembered promise\r\nfrom a boy in a dream?!",
  "SM_003010_0010_CER": "“...”",
  "LV_003045_0010_NAR": "Cheshire shouted his bravado so Cereza would hear.",
  "LV_003050_0000_CER": "I wonder if we're in that monster's territory. ",
  "LV_003080_0010_CER": "Please! \r\nTake me to the last Elemental Core.",
  "_31": "",
  "LV_003045_0020_NAR": "It did little to quell her worry.",
  "SM_003080_0130_FAS": "“Inside a fortress where \r\nonly the most malicious \r\nof the faeries reside.”",
  "BK_3020_0000_NAR": "The monster's wings were\r\nhard as steel. Cheshire's claws\r\nseemed like toys by comparison.",
  "SM_003035_0160_CER": "“Lukaon...\r\nI understand...I'll do my best!”",
  "BK_3000_0010_CER": "“The monster!”",
  "SM_003035_0085_LUC": "“What's more...”",
  "LV_003910_0060_CER": "Mummy...Mummy believed in me!",
  "LV_003920_0020_CER": "Ahh...\r\nNo more...\r\nBe quiet!",
  "LV_003070_0020_NAR": "Cheshire grumbled under his breath.\r\nHe was itching for a fight.",
  "SM_003035_0100_LUC": "“Your dream...\r\nYou long to save your mother, don't you?\r\n\r\nThat particular sorrow \r\nis one I know all too well.”",
  "SM_003080_0210_FAS": "“If you'd like me to guide you, \r\njust ask me any time.”",
  "SM_003030_0030_NAR": "Cheshire started grumbling about\r\nhow Cereza moving around the \r\nbattlefield made it hard to fight.\r\n",
  "SM_003035_0130_LUC": "“I want to go to her, to dry her tears!”",
  "LV_003920_0010_CER": "W-what?!",
  "LV_003065_0000_CER": "This looks like a piece of its hide...\r\nSo it's not completely invincible! ",
  "LV_003070_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Like I'd turn around now.[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_003080_0220_FAS": "“Think of it as showing \r\nmy gratitude for taking \r\ncare of those pesky faeries.”",
  "SM_003030_0000_NAR": "The vile Jabberwock had been defeated;\r\nCereza was ecstatic.",
  "SM_003030_0080_CER": "“Ah!”",
  "SM_003050_0030_CER": "“Morgana, I defeated a giant monster!\r\nYou should have seen it!”",
  "CE_003040_0000_CER": "Cheshire!!!",
  "SM_003010_0060_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Just stay out of my way![FONT:N ]\r\nwas all the demon could muster.",
  "SM_003040_0090_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]If I don't make it back to Inferno,\r\nthe last thing I do in this\r\nmiserable world will be\r\ntearing you limb from limb![FONT:N ]\r\nroared the furious demon.",
  "SM_003040_0020_CER": "“Hmm?\r\n Oh, it's nothing.\r\n\r\nAnyways, there is something \r\nI should explain while I have the chance.”",
  "SM_003010_0050_NAR": "He remembered the battle.\r\nThis was the first time \r\nhe had tasted defeat\r\nand he did not like it one bit.",
  "LV_003075_0010_CER": "Look at all of them...",
  "SM_003010_0020_NAR": "Cereza stood silently, fists clenched.\r\nMore than anything, she was angry \r\nat herself for once again \r\nsuccumbing to her fear.",
  "SM_003020_0060_NAR": "Invigorated from the battle,\r\nCereza was almost confident.\r\nCheshire was in a sour mood.",
  "SM_003080_0020_FAS": "“I never expected a witch \r\nto come along and beat him.”",
  "LV_003025_0010_NAR": "Cereza could not shake the feeling that\r\nAvalon Forest itself conspired against her.",
  "BK_3020_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]You pathetic weakling![FONT:N ]\r\nThe cuddly body did not take\r\nthe edge off his harsh words.",
  "LV_003030_0000_CER": "What was that?!",
  "SM_003080_0010_FAS": "“You even took care of the \r\nmonstrous Jabberwock,\r\nviolent even by faerie standards.”",
  "SM_003035_0040_CER": "“I'm Cereza.”",
  "SM_003080_0180_FAS": "“I'm tired of those cruel \r\nfaeries myself. I'm hoping you \r\ncan show them what's what!”",
  "SM_003050_0200_CER": "“Ugh, you're hopeless!”",
  "LV_003900_0000_CER": "Woooo!\r\nI'm flying!",
  "LV_003915_0010_NAR": "I can't cry...I've got to be strong!\r\nShe whispered to herself quietly, \r\nso that Cheshire would not hear.",
  "SM_003035_0140_LUC": "“Cereza, please break my curse.\r\nIf you destroy the final Elemental Core\r\nand come to the heart of the forest,\r\nmy dream...our dream will become a reality!”",
  "LV_003020_0010_CER": "No way...nothing has claws this big...right?",
  "LV_003035_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]You want to find the next Elemental Core, right? Get going then![FONT:N ]",
  "SM_003080_0050_CER": "“No, we're fine.”",
  "SM_003050_0150_NAR": "After Morgana's spectre had vanished,\r\nCheshire let out an angry growl.",
  "LV_003910_0020_CER": "I don't...want to run any more!",
  "SM_003050_0110_MOR": "“The strength of the faerie magic that \r\nprotects Avalon is immense.\r\nIt will require an equally\r\npowerful spell to break.\r\n\r\nI have begun my incantation,\r\nbut it will take until dawn to complete...\r\nYou must survive until then.”",
  "SM_003080_0060_CER": "“Hey, how about telling us where \r\nto find the last Elemental Core!”",
  "LV_003040_0010_NAR": "It was a cage, big enough to swallow up\r\nMorgana's manor whole.",
  "LV_003055_0000_CER": "We're getting closer...\r\nIt's nearby, I know it.",
  "SM_003050_0080_MOR": "“I believe you are ready \r\nfor more powerful magic techniques.\r\n\r\nThey will allow you to draw\r\nout the true strength of your familiar.”",
  "LV_003910_0000_CES": "Running away from everything.\r\nIs that how you plan to become a witch?",
  "CE_003030_0000_CER": "Uh oh, what now?\r\nI think we made it mad?",
  "SM_003050_0050_MOR": "“It is a miracle you escaped unscathed.\r\nI thought I told you to find a safe\r\nplace and stay put!”",
  "SM_003030_0090_NAR": "Putting their argument on pause,\r\nthey ran to keep up\r\nwith the white wolf.",
  "SM_003035_0030_LUC": "“I am Lukaon. \r\nAnd you?”",
  "LV_003070_0000_CER": "I won't run any more.\r\nCome on, Cheshire!",
  "SM_003030_0020_CER": "“What're you sulking \r\nabout this time? We won!”",
  "SM_003035_0000_LUC": "“My, you managed to defeat \r\nthe ferocious Jabberwock.\r\nIt's hard to believe you are\r\nthe same girl who I found sobbing\r\nall alone in a dark nightmare.\r\nYou truly have grown strong.”",
  "BK_3030_0040_NAR": "His claws found their mark, \r\nbut once again left \r\nthe beast unperturbed.",
  "LV_003920_0030_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Get ahold of yourself! Move![FONT:N ]\r\ngrowled the demon, \r\ntrying to shake Cereza from her stupor. ",
  "SM_003050_0010_NAR": "Morgana's projection appeared \r\nbefore her once again.\r\n\r\nShe seemed relieved.\r\n",
  "SM_003050_0100_CER": "“What?”",
  "SM_003050_0060_MOR": "“...But I must admit I am surprised.\r\nPerhaps you have grown more\r\nthan I thought.”",
  "LV_003005_0010_CER": "Was someone watching us...",
  "LV_003910_0030_CES": "You're scared, aren't you?\r\nJust go cry in the corner, you coward!",
  "SM_003050_0180_NAR": "Cheshire snorted in response.\r\n",
  "BK_3000_0000_NAR": "Munch, Munch...",
  "PH_3020_0010_CER": "There!",
  "SM_003035_0090_CER": "“What is it?”",
  "LV_003075_0000_NAR": "Broken cages were scattered everywhere.",
  "LV_003060_0010_CER": "There has to be something I can do.",
  "BK_3020_0060_NAR": "Cheshire tried desperately to transform, \r\nbut with Cereza's magic in flux from fear,\r\nhis body remained tiny.",
  "CE_003020_0010_CER": "Ugh!",
  "SM_003040_0000_NAR": "Another meeting with Lukaon.\r\nRemembering the dream sent\r\nCereza's young heart aflutter.",
  "SM_003010_0070_CER": "“...”",
  "LV_003015_0000_CER": "Okay, wow, that's high.\r\nIt'll be fine. Just don't. Look. Down.",
  "SM_003040_0110_CER": "“Nothing!\r\nCome on, let's go find that Core.”",
  "SM_003080_0160_FAS": "“We can hope...”",
  "BK_3020_0050_NAR": "Like a hawk hunting mice, \r\nthe draconic faerie searched for its prey.",
  "LV_003045_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Next time that thing shows its ugly mug\r\nI'm going to beat it to a pulp![FONT:N ]",
  "LV_003080_0000_CER": "The white wolf!\r\nGlad to see you're safe.",
  "SM_003050_0210_NAR": "And with that,\r\nCereza's good mood disappeared \r\nas quickly as it had come.",
  "SM_003010_0080_NAR": "Lost in despair of her own,\r\nCereza barely heard his words.\r\n",
  "SM_003080_0110_FAS": "“Dear, dear...”",
  "SM_003080_0080_FAS": "“Miss...I've often said, \r\nhurrying will get you nowhere.”",
  "SM_003020_0040_CER": "“Oh, thank goodness...”",
  "SM_003035_0170_CER": "“I want to know more about you.\r\nThere is so much we have in common!”\r\n",
  "SM_003080_0120_FAS": "“The final Elemental Core...\r\nis in a particularly tricky \r\npart of this forest.”",
  "BK_3020_0010_NAR": "It had found a new target.\r\nCereza knew she must fight,\r\nbut she was petrified with fear.",
  "SM_003010_0030_CER": "“Cheshire's attacks didn't \r\nmake so much as a dent in\r\nthat monster's armour...\r\n\r\nW-what am I going to do?”",
  "SM_003040_0040_NAR": "Cereza told Cheshire the reason she\r\nhad entered Avalon Forest.\r\nLukaon appearing in her dream;\r\nher quest to save her mother;\r\nand the power she was promised,\r\nthat waited at the heart of the forest.",
  "CE_003000_0000_CER": "Come on, let me help!",
  "BK_3030_0120_CER": "“No more running away!”",
  "SM_003035_0070_LUC": "“I am trapped deep in the heart \r\nof this forest by a powerful curse.”",
  "SM_003050_0170_CER": "“Oh, Morgana always talks like that.\r\nDon't worry, I know you're\r\nnot just some kind of weapon.\r\n\r\nBut, it wouldn't kill you to listen\r\nto my advice once in a while.”",
  "SM_003080_0150_CER": "“Oh, we'll go all right!\r\nI'm a witch. And I'm way stronger now\r\nthan when I set foot in this forest.”",
  "SM_003050_0020_MOR": "“Cereza, you look...different.\r\nDid something happen, my dear?”",
  "BK_8110_0010_CER": "“What's wrong?\r\nNot even interested in getting\r\na new power any more?”",
  "BK_3030_0000_NAR": "They found themselves face to face\r\nwith the monster once again. ",
  "CE_003800_0000_CER": "That looks like it would hurt...\r\nFocus! Got to keep moving!",
  "BK_3030_0110_CER": "“No, not this time!”",
  "SM_003030_0060_CER": "“You do realise it was thanks to my help\r\nyou were able to defeat that thing, right?\r\nYou could at least say a word of thanks!”"
}
